# Raw page captures dropped here by hand, for an adapter to be written against.
# Ignored by default rather than reviewed case by case: this is a folder things
# arrive in straight from a browser, and one of them will eventually be a
# logged-in page. What belongs in the repo is the *trimmed* fixture under
# `src/test/fixtures`, whose header records what was cut and what must survive a
# retrim.
docs/filesForAgent/
